## Story Description
The calculateTotal function in src/cart.ts is applying the discount twice when a coupon code is provided. A 10% coupon should reduce a $100 cart to $90, but the current implementation reduces it to $81. Fix the bug so the discount is applied exactly once. The source file(s) are in /tmp/epam-bench-epam-ts-001-LutNKy/src/. Do not modify the test files.

